      "description": "Consumer Purchase & Subscriptions\n\nThe Consumer Purchase & Subscriptions team processes and manages orders for consumers of Microsoft products across the globe, both digital and physical.  Here are some highlights of my work on the team:\n\n- Helped implement a microservices architecture and maintained services across purchase and order-processing systems.\n- Assisted with migration of the main service to .NET and Azure.\n- Helped implement a feature enabling consumers to redeem digital products, including Xbox games and Office products.\n- Added telemetry, dashboards, and alerts to monitor service behavior.\n Created onboarding documentation supporting four new hires; hosted department knowledge-sharing and team learning sessions.",
      "insights": ""
