      "description": "Consumer Purchase & Subscriptions\n\nThe Consumer Purchase & Subscriptions team processes and manages orders and subscriptions for consumers of Microsoft products across the globe, both digital and physical.  During my time as an apprentice, I quickly ramped up on coding fundamentals and was able to contribute to the team in the following ways:\n\n- Helped build an asynchronous job to identify orders requiring manual attention.\n- Served as a team subject-matter expert for an internal telemetry service.\n- Added telemetry, dashboards, and alerts to monitor service scenarios.",
